{
  "slug": "dreamforge-audit",
  "name": "Dreamforge Audit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Comprehensive application auditor — runs parallel agents to check code quality, workflow gaps, security (OWASP), help docs, and performance. Produces timestamped reports with severity ratings, fix instructions, and effort estimates. Works on any project.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `apple-hig-compliance` (Audit, plan, implement, and verify mobile-responsive web UI/UX using Apple Human Interface Guidelines adapted for the web, WCAG…), `audit-my-app` (Comprehensive application auditor that reads project context, asks what to audit, runs parallel audit agents, and produces a…), `security-scanner` (Performs comprehensive OWASP Top 10:2025 security vulnerability analysis on any codebase), `start-an-app` (Interview the user in depth about what they actually want to build, then scaffold a working full-stack web…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dreamforge-audit@claude-community` from `brainit-consulting/DreamForgeSoftwareAgentSkills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
